{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block content %}
<section class="hero">
<span class="eyebrow">Weekly &middot; curated &middot; calm</span>
<hgroup>
<h1>The AI industry, one calm read a week.</h1>
<h2>Signalweek is a curated weekly digest of what actually moved in AI &mdash; sorted into a fixed five-category taxonomy, every item citing a primary source.</h2>
</hgroup>
<p>
No infinite scroll, no personalisation, no accounts. Every Monday a single
issue covers what happened across models, policy, funding, research, and
the industry moves that shaped the week.
</p>
<div class="trust-bar" aria-label="What each issue covers">
<span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 3.5 6 11 2.5 7.5l1-1L6 9l6.5-6.5z"/></svg> Models</span>
<span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 3.5 6 11 2.5 7.5l1-1L6 9l6.5-6.5z"/></svg> Lawsuits &amp; policy</span>
<span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 3.5 6 11 2.5 7.5l1-1L6 9l6.5-6.5z"/></svg> Funding</span>
<span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 3.5 6 11 2.5 7.5l1-1L6 9l6.5-6.5z"/></svg> Research</span>
<span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 3.5 6 11 2.5 7.5l1-1L6 9l6.5-6.5z"/></svg> Industry moves</span>
</div>
</section>

<section class="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
<h2 id="how-heading" class="section-heading">How each issue is built</h2>
<ol class="steps">
<li>
<h3>We watch a curated source list</h3>
<p>Signalweek pulls from a hand-picked list of AI publications, blogs, and primary announcements &mdash; the same set for every reader.</p>
</li>
<li>
<h3>We cluster and categorise</h3>
<p>Stories covering the same event are merged into a single item and slotted into one of five categories.</p>
</li>
<li>
<h3>You read one calm page</h3>
<p>Every Monday a new issue is published to the public archive, with every item citing a primary source you can click through.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>

{% endblock %}
